  "content_html": "<h1>a feeling of free will</h1>\n<p class=\"momentDate\">23 Oct 2024</p>\n<div data-docs-catalogue-ref=\"c1\"><figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--full-column\" data-docs-content-detail=\"media\" data-docs-media-kind=\"catalogue-work\" data-docs-media-id=\"04644\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"docsViewer__mediaImageLink docsViewerFigure__imageLink\" data-docs-media-open aria-label=\"Open a feeling of free will\"><img data-docs-media-image src=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04644-primary-800.webp?v=1\" srcset=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04644-primary-800.webp?v=1 800w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04644-primary-1200.webp?v=1 1200w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/04644-primary-1600.webp?v=1 1600w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"a feeling of free will\" width=\"1600\" height=\"998\" decoding=\"async\"><span data-docs-media-placeholder hidden>a feeling of free will</span></button></figure></div>\n<pre class=\"moment-text\">\nan\nunrealisable\nfeeling\nof\nfree\nwill\nthat\nstretches\nfor\nhours\nand\nyears\nbefore\nbeing\ncrushed\nunder\nits\nown\nweight\nof\nexpectation\nwhich\nit\nhad\nfailed\nto\nproperly\nunderstand\nand\nso\nconsequently\nwas\nunprepared\nfor\nwhen\na\npreviously\nunknowable\ninfluence\nappeared\nas\nan\nuncertainty\nthat\ni\nfound\nimpossible\nto\nreconcile\nleading\nto\na\ncondition\nof\nexponentially\nincreasing\ndoubt\nthat\nultimately\nmade\nthe\nwhole\nconcept\nmeaningless\nresulting\nin\nan\nunresolvable\nfeeling\nof\nfree\nwill\nthat\nmay\npossibly\nlast\nforever\n</pre>\n",
